<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel, banks reach debt deal - radio.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel, banks reach debt deal - radio.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>French radio France Info reported on Tuesday that Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA /Plc and its bankers have reached a global agreement on a debt restructuring which will be finalised on Tuesday evening.</p>
</text>
